  "instructions": [
    "Fill a large pot with 2 inches of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to a simmer and place a steamer basket over the water.",
    "Add the broccoli florets to the steamer basket and cover with a lid.",
    "Steam the broccoli for 5 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a small saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, or until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the crumbly cheese, sour cream, salt, black pepper, and paprika.",
    "Combine the cooked broccoli and cheese mixture in a lacquerware bowl."
